title: Initiative: the State and Society
subtitle: A bill of PPS: the Sejm votes on it next month.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: parliament_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.initiativeCardAvailable(Q, 'state') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card parliament.legislative_initiative, its second part (Z — 1.09, decision 6aA of 8 XI 2026): the laws of the state and
// society; the laws of labour and the economy are on polish_legislative_initiative.
// At most four laws of a fixed order; taking one up costs 1 resource and this month's action and
// moves relations at once; the next month the urgent card polish_initiative_vote puts it to the Sejm (technical reference 7.2).
PolishProjects.initiativeView(Q);
!}

= Initiative: the State and Society

The club of PPS can file a bill of its own on the state, the army, the school, the minorities and the land. We choose one matter, and next month the Sejm votes on it. A law passed in full leaves this card; one passed only in its limited version, rejected or withdrawn comes back after nine months.

- @army_oversight
- @secular_school
- @autonomy
- @land_reform
- @abortion
- @skip
- @easy_discard

@army_oversight
title: Civilian oversight of the army
subtitle: [+ pl_ini_army_oversight_line +]
view-if: {! return PolishProjects.initiativeIsShown(Q, 'army_oversight') !}
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.initiativeStatus(Q, 'army_oversight').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ini_army_oversight_why +] [+ pl_ini_army_oversight_line +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_ini_result = PolishProjects.initiativeFile(Q, 'army_oversight');
!}
go-to: result

